WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:01.480
Carrying on the family line

00:02.040 --> 00:03.160
Is the foundation of the state

00:03.880 --> 00:04.880
Building the imperial harem

00:04.880 --> 00:06.280
Must not be taken lightly either

00:07.160 --> 00:07.920
Yes

00:09.520 --> 00:10.240
Then your servant

00:10.520 --> 00:12.760
Will take this year's expenditure plan

00:13.040 --> 00:14.680
And readjust it again

00:15.000 --> 00:15.680
Go

00:16.000 --> 00:16.680
I am tired

00:17.160 --> 00:17.800
All withdraw

00:18.520 --> 00:19.160
Your servant

00:19.640 --> 00:20.400
Takes leave

00:24.000 --> 00:35.000
Upon returning to his residence, Xie Jian'an swiftly drafted a new imperial budget and rebuilt the imperial harem, gathering the realm's finest beauties for you and constructing pavilions of jade.

00:45.120 --> 00:46.520
Your Majesty

00:46.640 --> 00:48.760
Whose name tablet will you turn tonight?
